  <item>
    <title>EP62 | 【之行合一】怦然心动的人生整理魔法导读</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6686cab50bc5d7cc70e3cd24</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6686cab50bc5d7cc70e3cd24</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 05 Jul 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Host: York &amp; Estelle (台大药学、HEC Paris MBA、Organizational Leadership博士班在读、目前任职医药谘询顾问公司）</span><br><span></span></p><span></span><p><span>York和Estelle 这次想与大家分享他们最近搬家的经历和心得：分享在搬家的过程中所遇到的挑战和收获，比如如何处理旧物品，如何打包，如何断舍离，以及在这过程中体会到的整理的重要性。在整理的过程中想到了Ｍarie Kondo的《The Life-Changing Magic of Tidying Up: The Japanese Art of Decluttering and Organizing》这本书，它的整理心法不仅适用于物品的整理，还能应用到我们的心灵整理上。今天我们就来深入探讨这本书，分享其中的精华。</span><br><span></span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.amazon.com/-/zh_TW/Life-Changing-Magic-Tidying-Decluttering-Organizing%E3%80%8B/dp/1607747308/ref=sr_1_1?crid=26Y97FSJEASG9&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.MfJls4pNTQs38PzFctjl0zKIAJO0oa-vd2FkwaPVLwrWnXs7G68ONktHHQ0nTvj7zAKCTefTOU1OgHwsnXqBjO3ePdZoDDq61wruOcHSXVwyPpER9V8le0zTK6vO5ybAkjqUjgYAgyXbXM7qG_o2BU8nqc6SheBg51Id9bPLcHGGRu-pqSEq-zoqWtw-z1pYB7XLk5ZdufQNstxJuHWfPVt2TCSk0N7c4r4Ker3TGDI.7WIGKTyH3DdrBUEWwqg8Yu3YahvefzWgz-CMnkA7gB8&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=The+Life-Changing+Magic+of+Tidying+Up%3A+The+Japanese+Art+of+Decluttering+and+Organizing&amp;qid=1720107741&amp;sprefix=the+life-changing+magic+of+tidying+up+the+japanese+art+of+decluttering+and+organizing%2Caps%2C302&amp;sr=8-1" data-url="https://www.amazon.com/-/zh_TW/Life-Changing-Magic-Tidying-Decluttering-Organizing%E3%80%8B/dp/1607747308/ref=sr_1_1?crid=26Y97FSJEASG9&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.MfJls4pNTQs38PzFctjl0zKIAJO0oa-vd2FkwaPVLwrWnXs7G68ONktHHQ0nTvj7zAKCTefTOU1OgHwsnXqBjO3ePdZoDDq61wruOcHSXVwyPpER9V8le0zTK6vO5ybAkjqUjgYAgyXbXM7qG_o2BU8nqc6SheBg51Id9bPLcHGGRu-pqSEq-zoqWtw-z1pYB7XLk5ZdufQNstxJuHWfPVt2TCSk0N7c4r4Ker3TGDI.7WIGKTyH3DdrBUEWwqg8Yu3YahvefzWgz-CMnkA7gB8&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=The+Life-Changing+Magic+of+Tidying+Up%3A+The+Japanese+Art+of+Decluttering+and+Organizing&amp;qid=1720107741&amp;sprefix=the+life-changing+magic+of+tidying+up+the+japanese+art+of+decluttering+and+organizing%2Caps%2C302&amp;sr=8-1"><span>The Life-Changing Magic of Tidying Up: The Japanese Art of Decluttering and Organizing</span></a><br><span></span><a href="https://www.eslite.com/product/1001112702074872" data-url="https://www.eslite.com/product/1001112702074872"><span>怦然心动的人生整理魔法</span></a><br><span></span><a href="https://konmari.com/" data-url="https://konmari.com/"><span>Marie Kondo</span></a><br><span></span></p><span></span><p><span>关于【之行合一】</span><br><span>结合「知行合一」的概念和Estelle名字中的「之」字。期望以个人风格的独特视角，在理解知识的基础上付诸实践，达到智慧增长与行动合一。我们期望通过这系列的节目，分享给听众生动的故事和共鸣，和大家一起透过这些特别的人生经历，一起体验在生活中实现自我提升与内外成长的感动。</span><br><span></span></p><span></span><p><span>[本内容不代表医疗专业处方，若需要专业医疗建议，请谘询医师]</span></p><span></span><p><span>合作邀约：chouyushuo168@gmail.com</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://open.firstory.me/user/chouyushuo168/platforms" data-url="https://open.firstory.me/user/chouyushuo168/platforms"><span>本节目也可在这些平台中收听</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://pay.soundon.fm/podcasts/6dffc14d-66d6-4f2f-a781-0d37e5ec6a69" data-url="https://pay.soundon.fm/podcasts/6dffc14d-66d6-4f2f-a781-0d37e5ec6a69"><span>小额赞助支持本节目</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://reurl.cc/blva8M" data-url="https://reurl.cc/blva8M"><span>健康咨询AI</span></a></p>]]></description>
